actually primarily a civilian issue. And I was&nbsp;
so happy to hear from you Maya you know how the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:18.480
ICRC cares about humanitarian issues more broadly&nbsp;
than just military ones. Last year for example

