00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:05.600
right? At least from what we've seen so far on&nbsp;
the trajectory of autonomous weapons is a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:16:05.600 --> 00:16:11.200
the people looking into making these can be sort&nbsp;
