concerns that you start to lose control I mean&nbsp;
we civil society have framed our concerns on&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:31.280
this issue often in terms of the need to retain&nbsp;
meaningful human control. I think there is a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:18:31.840 --> 00:18:37.840
