00:19:19.840 --> 00:19:26.320
is a significant concern, but also then these&nbsp;
potentially unintended scaling of effects which&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:26.880 --> 00:19:30.560
I think where you start to get security&nbsp;
concerns you know is it possible that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:19:31.440 --> 00:19:36.400
incidents occur inadvertently and they start to&nbsp;
escalate through these interconnected systems&nbsp;&nbsp;

