the themes there I mean the Stop Killer Robots&nbsp;
Campaign is a partnership of you know hundreds of&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:33.600 --> 01:02:38.800
organizations people working together coming from&nbsp;
different backgrounds concerned with this issue.&nbsp;&nbsp;

