I've worked on the development of a number&nbsp;
of international legal instruments and&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:43.840 --> 01:02:49.600
political instruments on weapons and all of those&nbsp;
processes have relied ultimately on a partnership&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:02:49.600 --> 01:02:58.080
of states along with international organizations&nbsp;
like the ICRC, UN agencies and UN officials&nbsp;&nbsp;

