and then civil society and the wider social&nbsp;
community of stakeholders. And I think&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:04.960 --> 01:03:10.640
that's going to be the key to to making&nbsp;
progress on this issue. Like Maya,&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:10.640 --> 01:03:16.000
I would pay tribute to the work that FLI has done&nbsp;
particularly bringing the voices of technologists&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:21.840
and scientists into this, you know, so strongly&nbsp;
into this debate because those voices are you know&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:22.480 --> 01:03:28.960
fundamentally important in this issue of our&nbsp;
relationship to technology in society. I think&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:28.960 --> 01:03:34.960
we have these partnerships building up now this is&nbsp;
basically back to grounds for optimism. I think we&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:03:34.960 --> 01:03:40.080
have a majority of states who are engaged in the&nbsp;
