keeping human control in the use of force&nbsp;
and avoiding a sort of dehumanization&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:04:14.880 --> 01:04:19.120
both of the people that you know would be killed&nbsp;
but also perhaps of ourselves as you know if we're&nbsp;&nbsp;

