me is the power of AI, right? We're going to go&nbsp;
in one direction or another. It's not going to&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:14.800 --> 01:09:20.080
be some sort of mediocre future that we have with&nbsp;
artificial intelligence. It's either going to be&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:20.080 --> 01:09:25.600
one that is that beautiful positive flourishing&nbsp;
vision or it's a it's a pretty dark one, right?&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:25.600 --> 01:09:31.920
And the ability to steer which direction we go&nbsp;
in lies in our hands today and I think that's why&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:09:32.480 --> 01:09:37.520
we're so optimistic is the fact that we&nbsp;
see that vision. We see that vision of AI&nbsp;&nbsp;

