01:10:02.160 --> 01:10:07.920
wisdom on some of these early use cases and I&nbsp;
think that is at the core what we're talking&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:07.920 --> 01:10:13.280
about with this whole panel today, which is lethal&nbsp;
autonomous weapons are a very early decision we&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:13.280 --> 01:10:19.280
need to make about our control of AI and steering&nbsp;
it in a which direction it shall go in towards the&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:10:19.280 --> 01:10:26.640
future. And we have this opportunity now to to&nbsp;
